(177, 24, 'Women Wellness Mobile App - Cycle Tracking & AI UX', '👋\nIntroducing a modern wellness mobile app designed to support women through every phase of their cycle.\n\nThis concept focuses on creating a calm, intuitive, and emotionally supportive experience — combining cycle tracking, symptom logging, and AI-powered insights in one seamless interface.\n\nWe designed a soft and minimal UI that feels natural and non-intrusive, using warm gradients, clean typography, and carefully structured layouts. The goal was to turn complex health data into something easy to understand, while making the experience feel personal and reassuring.\n\nThe product goes beyond tracking — it helps users understand their body, recognize patterns, and receive gentle guidance tailored to their current state.\n\nLooking to design a meaningful product in health, AI, or mobile? Let’s talk — message me.\n👉📩', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47733930/file/c68a6cfcf07a7c27aebbb1536d586019.jpg?resize=400x0', '2026-05-15 11:59:42', '2026-05-15 11:59:42'),
