(201, 28, 'Rock Paper Scissors - Casino Game', '🦄  Bang Bang is accepting new projects for work.\n\n__________________\n\n👍 We appreciate your support, press ❤️ to support Bang!\n\nExplored a futuristic take on the classic Rock Paper Scissors experience by transforming it into a high-energy casino game interface with a strong cyberpunk atmosphere and competitive betting flow.\n\nThe goal was to combine playful game mechanics with a premium iGaming aesthetic using glowing neon lighting, cinematic composition, volumetric effects, and detailed 3D elements. I focused heavily on creating depth, clarity, and excitement through the UI - from the robotic hand interaction to the vibrant betting controls and immersive dashboard system.\n\nThis concept was designed as a modern gambling and gaming experience that could fit seamlessly into a crypto casino, esports betting platform, or next-generation multiplayer game ecosystem.', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47731085/file/3a57961990fed95ab5a557d4082a5077.png?resize=400x0', '2026-05-15 11:59:53', '2026-05-15 11:59:53'),
