(321, 20, 'Shipping Logistic Dashboard', 'Redefining Logistics Dashboard — Faster Tracking, Smarter Operations 🚚\n\nThis logistics dashboard concept was designed to simplify shipment monitoring, fleet utilization, and operational analytics into one streamlined interface. By combining real-time tracking, dark-mode visuals, structured data cards, and high-contrast charts, the experience feels more focused, scalable, and easier to navigate for modern logistics teams.\n\nThoughts on this dashboard? Let me know below.', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47731309/file/96defc530f559e02857130417b77df75.png?resize=400x0', '2026-05-15 12:00:40', '2026-05-15 12:00:40'),
