(344, 20, 'Clean Energy - News Page', 'Redefining Logistics Dashboard — Faster Tracking, Smarter Operations 🚚\n\nThis logistics dashboard concept was designed to simplify shipment monitoring, fleet utilization, and operational analytics into one streamlined interface. By combining real-time tracking, dark-mode visuals, structured data cards, and high-contrast charts, the experience feels more focused, scalable, and easier to navigate for modern logistics teams.\n\nThoughts on this dashboard? Let me know below.', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47370811/file/88d4879f24c7a42c9b43c82ca8bc4718.png?resize=400x0', '2026-05-15 12:00:40', '2026-05-15 12:00:40'),
(345, 42, 'House Illustration🏠', 'Our latest project,\n\"House Illustration🏠\"\n\nFrom cozy classics to modern dream homes ✨🏡 Your ideas deserve visuals that feel warm, memorable, and full of personality. With a clean cartoon illustration style, every detail is designed to make property, architecture, or lifestyle content more eye-catching and client-friendly. Perfect for branding, social media, ads, and promotional visuals that instantly feel like “home.”\n\nIf you’re looking for a brand mascot illustration that connects emotionally with your audience, send me a message on Dribbble or find me on social media.\n\nDesigned by Catalyst Labs.', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47731010/file/8a563a35f1b943222fe1c624e8e90c23.png?resize=400x0', '2026-05-15 12:00:45', '2026-05-15 12:00:45'),
