(567, 33, 'NOMMM — Snack Brand Logo Concept', 'A playful logo concept created for a snack brand built around taste, craving, and instant reaction.\n\nThe idea was to turn the expression “nommm” into a bold visual mark by combining typography with a stylized mouth shape — creating something simple, memorable, and full of personality.\n\nFocused on soft curves, chunky lettering, and strong contrast to give the brand a fun, modern, and highly recognizable feel across packaging and digital applications.\n\nMinimal. Tasty. Loud enough to make you hungry.', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47724892/file/1ff153a67ac624f3210c753da180312d.jpg?resize=400x0', '2026-05-15 12:01:36', '2026-05-15 12:01:36'),
