(591, 86, 'Vextra – Digital Financial OS Animation', 'Vextra is a digital financial operating system designed to serve as the intelligent backbone of modern global commerce. Much like a central nervous system that coordinates complex transactions into a singular, fluid motion, Vextra unifies fragmented capital streams, integrating multi-currency banking, institutional-grade investments, and real-time treasury management into one automated\necosystem.\n\nIt\noperates as a \"Finance as Code\" platform, abstracting the manual friction of legacy banking silos and transforming raw, volatile market data into structured, actionable wealth. By bridging the gap between local liquidity and global market execution, Vextra empowers individuals and enterprises to scale their financial horizons with speed, precision, and complete digital traceability.', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47734013/file/still-677cfbaa10a705fad2ee4713e6085f52.png?resize=400x0', '2026-05-15 12:01:47', '2026-05-15 12:01:47'),
