(687, 48, 'RecruitSmart — Candidate Interview Timeline in School HRM', 'RecruitSmart, a School HR Management platform, consolidates all candidate interview schedules into a single screen as a direct solution to the inefficiency of searching for interview records one by one.\n\nEvery scheduled interview appears in a timeline view, organized by date, so admins and managers can see the full picture, who is coming up, who is in progress, and who has already been interviewed.\n\nEach interview card displays the current status and surfaces the relevant action directly: start a session when the time comes, or review the outcome and decide whether to advance or close the candidate once it is done.\n\nThe result is a faster, more structured hiring process. Decision-makers get everything they need in one place, so time is spent evaluating candidates, not tracking down their schedules.\n\nThe full showcase and extended case study are also live, search using: “\nRecruitSmart - SaaS HR Platform for Schools\n” on Google to find it.', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47679526/file/94f7da45d7b00f9cf261d77b8a44d4a5.png?resize=400x0', '2026-05-15 12:02:27', '2026-05-15 12:02:27'),
