(735, 36, 'Heart Bloom v2: Cardiology App - Brand Identity', 'Heart Bloom is a complete brand identity concept for a modern cardiology care platform. The project explores a cohesive healthcare ecosystem featuring a patient portal, heart health insights, article-based education, doctor scheduling, habit tracking, and personalized wellness experiences.\n\nThe visual language combines soft editorial aesthetics with clinical clarity — blending calming floral-inspired elements, rounded layouts, and subtle glassmorphism details to create a healthcare experience that feels both warm and professional.\n\nWhat Makes It Special:\n\nFloral-inspired visual language with calming organic details\n\nSoft blue-violet palette designed for warmth and trust\n\nEditorial-style layouts combined with healthcare functionality\n\nModern card-based UI system with clean and intuitive structure\n\nFulcrum’s all about blending tech with a human touch. This project isn’t just about looking good; it’s about making a connection. Designed to make digital healthcare more approachable, emotionally engaging, and visually memorable. Watch it, feel it, and let us know what you think!\n\nClick the ‘Get in Touch’ button – and let’s make something unforgettable!', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/userupload/47732767/file/169ea69542ae4c90d3114089251c52a2.jpg?resize=400x0', '2026-05-15 12:02:43', '2026-05-15 12:02:43'),
