(43, 'zondastudio', 'zondastudio', 'zondastudio@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', NULL, 'Zonda Studio designs and builds high-end websites and digital experiences for brands that care about aesthetics, clarity, and performance. From concept to execution, thoughtful UX, strong art direction, and refined craft. We work closely with founders and creative directors to translate their vision into considered digital experiences that hold up over time. We partner with brand-led businesses in fashion, beauty, lifestyle, hospitality, and e-commerce, categories where presentation, atmosphere, and detail matter as much as function. Named after the hot wind that blows down from the Andes, Zonda Studio is based in Argentina and works with brand-led businesses worldwide. Services · Web Design & Development · Brand Identity · E-commerce · UI/UX Design · Art Direction · Email Design · Product Imagery · UX Audits · Concept Decks Currently accepting new projects for 2026. Have a project in mind? Let’s get in touch. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:27:27', '2026-05-15 09:27:27'),
