(46, 'desire-creative_agency', 'desire-creative_agency', 'desire-creative_agency@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/11653188/avatars/normal/6c01c8c36485aad54d24218a55c4f00d.png?1776340002', 'Purrweb is a product design and development agency specializing in mobile and web applications for startups and tech companies. We deliver end-to-end solutions: • Brand identity • Graphic design • Motion design and 3D • Websites and Landing pages • UI/UX design & design systems What we\'ve built: • 100+ mobile and web apps shipped • SaaS platforms, fintech products, healthtech solutions, marketplaces • Apps published on App Store and Google Play • Design systems and component libraries Who works with us: • Startups needing MVP to investor pitch in 2-4 months • Scale-ups growing from 0 to 1M+ users • Enterprise teams that need product design support • Companies rebuilding legacy products Typical project scope: $10K—$150K+ (or ongoing retainers) Engagement model: Dedicated cross-functional team (designer + developer + PM) Communication: Weekly demos, transparent updates, friendly attitude If you\'re building a product and need both design excellence and rock-solid development, let\'s talk! |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:27:42', '2026-05-15 09:27:42'),
