(72, 'dujkovic', 'dujkovic', 'dujkovic@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/494360/avatars/normal/6d92d284721e82d3b333b052d99ad7c4.png?1568620537', 'I’m a brand identity designer with 15+ years of experience, helping startups, SaaS companies, and tech teams build clear, scalable brands through logo design and visual identity systems. I’m particularly focused on building brands from the ground up and rebranding for growth. For early-stage companies, I create structured visual systems that bring clarity, save time, and help them communicate and grow consistently. For established businesses, I align how they look with how they operate, introducing structure, clarity, and a more cohesive brand presence. I also collaborate with marketing agencies, providing reliable freelance design support when their teams need extra capacity across visual identity, logo design, presentations, collateral, social media, banner design, and event branding. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:31:32', '2026-05-15 09:31:32'),
(73, 'dusansol', 'dusansol', 'dusansol@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/976364/avatars/normal/81b91d27f89a6bb2c1e69f9b1e0da718.jpg?1682509323', 'I am Dusan from Serbia self taught designer, passionate artist and musician. My cup of tea are vintage/modern crafts. I tend to make new out of old without loosing authenticity and emotion. My work is specialised in Branding, illustration, Packaging & Handcrafted Typography. My craftsmanship is attention to details, creative flow and strong work etics. I always approach to the project as if i am working for myself Work speak louder than words.. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:31:44', '2026-05-15 09:31:44'),
(74, 'slabpixel', 'slabpixel', 'slabpixel@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/14885816/avatars/normal/7aee75c617b8b7ca01bea4d986df9f13.png?1675143317', 'We are SlabPixel, a creative agency based in Yogyakarta, Indonesia. Our forte lies in offering unlimited design services through a highly efficient and high-performing team, specializing in three core services: branding, digital experience, and development. Get in touch! |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:31:48', '2026-05-15 09:31:48'),
(75, 'batowebagency', 'batowebagency', 'batowebagency@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/14095940/avatars/normal/e584c0a059b6c7c4f4c23852153e5521.png?1669730203', 'Contact Us: Founded in 2014 in Ukraine, Bato is an agency of experts in web, UI/UX, and mobile design, as well as web development. We specialize in creating stunning websites from scratch. Our mission? To craft modern, pixel-perfect designs for any web product. If you\'ve got a site but aren’t quite sure about it, we’ll study it, refine it, and make it totally accurate and trendy. ✅ Working with us, you\'ll get: ▪️ Experienced Developers: Senior and Middle level – the best of the best! ▪️ Top-Notch Web Designers: Bringing your vision to life. ▪️ Full Project Support: We\'ve got your back, now and in the future. ▪️ Manager Support: Personalized assistance throughout your project. ▪️ Best Practices: Eight years of honed skills and expertise. ▪️ Proven Success: 224 projects tested and triumphantly delivered. ▪️ Pleasant Communication: A friendly, professional team ready to collaborate. Let’s create something amazing together! 🚀 |', '', 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:31:51', '2026-05-15 09:31:51'),
(76, 'David_Dreiling', 'David_Dreiling', 'David_Dreiling@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/1091150/avatars/normal/a3172a2ec93cc18801e6d839fdd0c90a.png?1672844337', 'Logo / Identity / Packaging / |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:31:54', '2026-05-15 09:31:54'),
(77, 'alaminhossen75', 'alaminhossen75', 'alaminhossen75@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/6077763/avatars/normal/e5307f7b8b1f086efdd5a5675dfd0659.png?1702234952', 'UI/UX & Product Designer for Startups & SaaS I help startups, founders, and growing businesses turn ideas into intuitive, scalable, and conversion-focused digital products. From MVP to full product, I design experiences that balance user needs + business goals—so your product not only looks great but performs. What I do: • SaaS & Startup Product Design • Web & Mobile UI/UX • Landing Pages that convert • Design Systems & Product Strategy Why clients choose me: • Business-focused design thinking • Clear & fast communication • Reliable, on-time delivery I have relevant experience in this industries & niches: SaaS, CRM, Dashboard, eCommerce, Healthcare, Real Estate, Crypto, Fintech, Social Media, Education, Sports & Fitness, Gambling & more. 📩 Available for new projects — let’s build something impactful |', '', 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:31:59', '2026-05-15 09:31:59'),
(78, 'roberlan', 'roberlan', 'roberlan@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/384937/avatars/normal/54862d88ac19e1a72003b88c3c895de0.png?1574277554', 'Brazilian illustrator, graphic and lettering designer with a colorful and psychedelic work. Exploring the possibilities of the vector art and pop art. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:03', '2026-05-15 09:32:03'),
(79, 'ilias-miah', 'ilias-miah', 'ilias-miah@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/24179979/avatars/normal/67ffb36eee1c960306b1253f70ca5c39.png?1765769668', 'As a passionate product designer and no-code website developer, I specialize in creating sleek, user-friendly digital products that resonate with users and drive engagement. With a knack for simplifying complex concepts, I translate ideas into intuitive, interactive experiences. Throughout my career, I have collaborated with cross-functional teams to deliver projects that not only meet but exceed client expectations. My expertise spans various industries, allowing me to bring a wide array of perspectives to the table. 🔧 Skills: #Product Design, #No-Code Development(Framer), #User Experience (UX), #User Interface (UI), #UI Animation(AE), #Prototyping 🌟 Passion & Philosophy: I believe in the power of design to bridge the gap between technology and users. My greatest joy comes from creating solutions that make people\'s lives easier and more enjoyable. When I\'m not designing, you can find me exploring the latest tech or perfecting my latte art. ☕️ Let\'s connect and create something amazing together! |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:07', '2026-05-15 09:32:07'),
(80, 'sansbrothers', 'sansbrothers', 'sansbrothers@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/9492995/avatars/normal/f2df69c0e8bf680e1ad0389c2913c608.png?1696384511', 'We provide a range of services for your business: • UI/UX Design (Landing Page & Website Specialist) • Weekly/Monthly Retainer Services • Website Development (Framer, Webflow, WordPress, Shopify) |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:13', '2026-05-15 09:32:13');
