(81, 'Skillinedesignco', 'Skillinedesignco', 'Skillinedesignco@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/9032824/avatars/normal/6819a4fc37a2a83e1cb16bee06fa67d3.jpg?1709019840', 'Meet Skilline: a design studio weaving narratives through lines, badges, and typography. Our line-based aesthetic redefines details as a powerful design language. The line becomes symbolic storytellers, while illustration emerges as a crafted art. If there is a project that you would like to collaborate on please do not hesitate to get in touch. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:21', '2026-05-15 09:32:21'),
(82, 'marcato', 'marcato', 'marcato@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/3020225/avatars/normal/118ab8cf8ae7ffe5b217ec8f89ef9572.png?1759461935', 'UI/UX | Web | 3D | Animation | Illustration |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:24', '2026-05-15 09:32:24'),
(83, 'Creliq', 'Creliq', 'Creliq@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/25523008/avatars/normal/883afadda2f157f9fea89478e8884edd.jpg?1767521411', 'Creliq is a product design agency focused on helping early-stage startups turn ideas into clear, usable MVPs. We work with founders at the pre-seed and seed stage who already have a vision, but feel stuck when it comes to product structure, user flows, or translating ideas into something engineers can confidently build. Our work centres on MVP UI and UX for early products. We focus on defining the core user journey, removing unnecessary complexity, and designing interfaces that are practical, understandable, and ready for development. We believe good product design is not about visual trends or polished marketing screens. It is about clarity, clear decisions, and a shared understanding of what matters clearly now and what can wait. Creliq typically supports startups building SaaS products, internal tools, and early mobile applications where focus and alignment are critical. If you are building an MVP and want a solid UX foundation before development or testing, we are open to thoughtful conversations. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:27', '2026-05-15 09:32:27'),
(84, 'michaelrayback', 'michaelrayback', 'michaelrayback@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/1784988/avatars/normal/5de032390cae28d3b414e7621c874681.jpg?1663759711', 'Art is self-expression, therefore all that you see here is a part of me. I know many languages of self-expression. I like drawing, I love photo art, cinema is one of the main parts of my life, I like cooking tasty and healthy food. I completely abandoned animal products. I wake up at five in the morning to be alone and tune in for a new day, and the sun tells me that I’m doing everything right and inspires me to new creativity. I do yoga and meditate. All this helps me to explore myself, I learn something new every day, and every day I try to be a little better. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:32', '2026-05-15 09:32:32'),
(85, 'sebastianabboud', 'sebastianabboud', 'sebastianabboud@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/210795/avatars/normal/759381c334c647c3a235a08826382c51.jpg?1776955099', 'I’m an illustrator and designer based in Nanaimo on Vancouver Island, BC, Canada. I’ve been lucky enough to work with brands, products, and people from all over the globe and I’m always open to new projects and collaborations. SELECT CLIENTS |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:39', '2026-05-15 09:32:39'),
(86, 'dipainhouse', 'dipainhouse', 'dipainhouse@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/4626561/avatars/normal/3e7a9cae12ddff5464716c73428efe8f.jpg?1631241699', 'Dipa Inhouse is a creative agency providing high quality services that help finding solutions with an intuitive approach that meet user’s business goal. We provide a high-quality service in design, branding & development. Let\'s reach a successful and quality output for your project! |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:45', '2026-05-15 09:32:45'),
(87, 'kevVader', 'kevVader', 'kevVader@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/270596/avatars/normal/03b498ce7c78d1842c094c12eb7e8c79.jpg?1715530021', 'In my career I’ve worked with all kinds of companies, providing bold designs that have meaning and serve a purpose. I traded conference rooms for coffee shops because I believe a personal approach is vital to a tailor made design. Being nimble and thoughtful has always, separated me from the big guys. I like to think Im like a design wolf, swift, focused, and a great listener. With me you’re never just another client on the roster, we’re partners in design. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:50', '2026-05-15 09:32:50'),
(88, 'vadim_web', 'vadim_web', 'vadim_web@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/5658506/avatars/normal/e25ea3fa6f3f61ba2d888d804d39da3c.jpg?1771780418', '🌐 I don’t just design—I build brands that dominate. With deep expertise in AI, Blockchain, and SaaS, I craft high-converting, premium designs that make your business stand out in a sea of competitors What I’ve Done (AKA The Proof 💰) ✺ Raised $2M+ at Seed Round with an investment presentation that hit HARD. ✺ 3X’d Social Media Engagement by re-engineering the content strategy on X (Twitter). ✺ Designed for AI Startup with 100+ B2B Sales, creating a UI that sells before the pitch. What I Can Do for You You want results? Let’s build your success roadmap. Book a consultation now, and by the end, you’ll have a clear, actionable strategy to hit your goals. 📩 Click below to get started |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:32:53', '2026-05-15 09:32:53'),
(89, 'designbyangie', 'designbyangie', 'designbyangie@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/3562273/avatars/normal/56da747ea420e22c26c36cdc35f59487.jpg?1774343697', 'Hi ! My name is Angie, a Vector Artist & Visual Designer with a love for bright colours, contrast & minimalism. I live in the South of the Netherlands, and am therefore located on the Amsterdam (GMT +1) timezone. I speak French & English, & work remotely as an artist at an international level. I specialise in digital illustrations. My visual language is strongly influenced by my initial design training. I add sparkles to people\'s ideas and make them come to life. The Artistique agency proudly represents me. For the past 15 years, I have kept busy with different kinds of projects: from logo creation, print jobs, packaging, to commercial illustrations, animations, NFT\'s and more. My personal belief is that art speak more than a thousand words. How can I help you today ? |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:33:04', '2026-05-15 09:33:04'),
(90, 'Reijo', 'Reijo', 'Reijo@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/1784672/avatars/normal/54901fd676ecbb9c3a41e5f375281871.jpg?1677862710', 'Product designer & product illustrator from Tallinn, Estonia 🇪🇪. Into all kinds of creative work. Open to new and awesome projects!🖋️🖌️ |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:33:11', '2026-05-15 09:33:11'),
(91, 'jkmahbub', 'jkmahbub', 'jkmahbub@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/8183066/avatars/normal/b09f04da5a1b5ddb764720ecba9ae22e.jpg?1684081077', 'Hey, this is JK Mahbub 🔥 a full-time freelance UI/UX designer. I am looking for and available to take on new projects. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:33:19', '2026-05-15 09:33:19'),
(92, 'Orizon', 'Orizon', 'Orizon@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/2554837/avatars/normal/90522438af4feba5ef21fe54cc40fec4.png?1559397767', 'Orizon is a leading design agency based in Canada. 🇨🇦 We help startups & Fortune 500 companies around the world delight humans on the other side of the screen. We offer a wide range of design services under one roof: audits, go-to-market strategies, UX, visual design, branding, 3d videos, implementation & more. We bring your ambitious ideas to life. As passionate designers, we love building products that are easy to use, accessible, engaging, and delightful. Our designers have worked with companies like Apple, RedBull, Uber Eats & Zara. Crafting world-class designs, we had an incredible impact on conversions, engagement, and retention for many brands. We\'ve designed products that went from $0 to $120,000,000 in revenue. Get support on a large platform, flesh out your first MVP, go from concept to investment, or take your startup to the next level. Our process wraps around your unique business needs. 🚀 |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:33:24', '2026-05-15 09:33:24'),
(93, 'samadara', 'samadara', 'samadara@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/405391/avatars/normal/1bb12664f5020713d948516cb53f9241.jpg?1769772122', 'I am a professional logo and brand identity designer with over 12 years of experience in crafting distinctive and impactful visual identities for brands across the globe I create simple, yet meaningful and unique logos that resonate with the core values and vision of the brand. Open to collaborate or discuss new projects. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:33:33', '2026-05-15 09:33:33'),
(94, 'tanbir-ahmed', 'tanbir-ahmed', 'tanbir-ahmed@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/2797062/avatars/normal/b8fbaf12e387c4b7b0c6f67deb066b21.jpg?1730181754', 'UI/UX Designer focused on building high-performing web and mobile products. I help businesses enhance usability, boost engagement, and drive measurable growth through clear, conversion-focused design. Available for client projects. : ̗̀➛ Servicesᵎ!ᵎ ✔️ SaaS Product Design ✔️ Dashboard & Web App UI/UX ✔️ Mobile App Design ✔️ Landing Pages & Marketing Websites ✔️ Wireframing & UX Strategy ✔️ Design Systems ✔️ Product Audits & Redesigns If you’re looking to enhance user experience, boost your product’s performance, or require reliable design support, please don\'t hesitate to get in touch—I’d be happy to collaborate. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:33:36', '2026-05-15 09:33:36'),
(95, 'Conceptzilla', 'Conceptzilla', 'Conceptzilla@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/1963775/avatars/normal/9064af06f08740a9c66b3c521d8778eb.png?1615560673', 'We specialize in turning ideas into reality. With over 500 successful projects and years of experience launching our own startups, we know what it takes to create impactful digital solutions that stand out. Our approach combines innovation, strategic thinking, and a passion for excellence to deliver exceptional results. We\'re ready to help your business thrive, no matter the challenge. |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:33:41', '2026-05-15 09:33:41'),
(96, 'purrwebui', 'purrwebui', 'purrwebui@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/5031392/avatars/normal/944b08efb66577ba400d5838490ea5b9.png?1597658879', 'Purrweb is a product design and development agency specializing in mobile and web applications for startups and tech companies. We deliver end-to-end solutions: • UI/UX design & design systems • Full-stack development (iOS, Android, React, Node.js) • From MVP to post-launch iterations What we\'ve built: • 100+ mobile and web apps shipped • SaaS platforms, fintech products, healthtech solutions, marketplaces • Apps published on App Store and Google Play • Design systems and component libraries Who works with us: • Startups needing MVP to investor pitch in 2-4 months • Scale-ups growing from 0 to 1M+ users • Enterprise teams that need product design support • Companies rebuilding legacy products Typical project scope: $10K—$150K+ (or ongoing retainers) Engagement model: Dedicated cross-functional team (designer + developer + PM) Communication: Weekly demos, transparent updates, friendly attitude If you\'re building a product and need both design excellence and rock-solid development, let\'s talk! |', NULL, 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:33:52', '2026-05-15 09:33:52'),
(97, 'agensip', 'agensip', 'agensip@dribbble.local', NULL, '12345678', 'https://cdn.dribbble.com/users/2547736/avatars/normal/0c4aff997b5469101760bff0f3c5c535.png?1536649020', 'We are an agency focused on UI & UX design for SaaS (B2B), Sport apps, and any digital products and applications. We do visual design for websites, mobile, desktops, visual branding, and many digital environment. Our design is tailored exclusively for every product based on its specific purpose. “DM us ‘uiux’ for a FREE quick audit”. |', '', 'user', NULL, '2026-05-15 09:34:03', '2026-05-15 09:34:03'),
